      "summary": "Surveyed the existing memory machinery and scoped the additions for large-model-on-few-GPUs, writing /workspace/impl_diffs/memory_strategy.md. INVENTORY (verified against live code): (1) zero3.py is DP-only param/state sharding (Zero3FlatParamStore full-pre-gather/release, bit-exact sharded checkpoints) with NO host-offload — every buffer is a device tensor, world=1 is a no-op, so it gives ZERO 1-GPU footprint relief. (2) distributed.py::ZeRO3Sharder.build_ds_config has an offload_optimizer flag but ONLY for the DeepSpeed engine, not the fused kernel. (3) Activations are stored FULL, all-layer, in HBM — dec_tc_acts_floats sums over `for li<L` (fused_decoder_megakernel.cuh:504-512) and DecActs holds per-layer X_in/X_ctx/X_x1/X_gact + dY_* arrays; there is NO recompute/checkpoint path (all 'recompute' greps are optimizer precompute, confirmed). (4) Weights are full, all-layer, in HBM (params blob + DecWBf bf16 stage of all kLayers); NO layer streaming. (5) The launcher cudaMallocs one device workspace; params/state/grad are device pointers — no pinned-host/UVM/staging anywhere. (6) The planner seam already exists: flagship_budget.per_rank_budget + auto_ncta (memory-fit-driven nCTA cap), and ParConfig's static-constexpr if-constexpr gates (kShardParams/kTPComm) + the kDecStagedOptScratch/SG_TUNED_DEC_DW_STAGE carve-to-0 pattern are the byte-identical-when-OFF mechanism. SCOPE: APPLY-READY (item A) = a new pure-Python planner mem_strategy.py (Hardware/MemPlan/plan_memory_strategy — escalates in-HBM -> nCTA-cap -> recompute -> offload -> stream purely by fit(footprint_after_strategy, usable_hbm), NEVER by GPU count) + a new mem_config.cuh gate POD (MemConfig<OffloadOpt,RecomputeActs,StreamLayers,StreamDepth>, default InHbm = byte-identical, sibling to SingleGPU) + harness wiring that emits -DSG_MEM_* macros from the planner verdict. REAL CHANGES (scoped, gated byte-identical OFF): (C) optimizer host-offload via pinned-host state + per-tensor-group P3 stage tiles (element-local OptIds only); (D) activation recompute via keeping only X_in layer-boundary acts and re-running per-layer fwd in dectc_backward_tile (biggest enabler, most invasive); (E) layer streaming via pinned-host params + a kStreamDepth device ring (deepest; partially breaks the single-persistent-launch invariant, deferred-path). Each is tied to if-constexpr/#if SG_MEM_* so OFF = zero extra PTX. Gate cmd 1 (import zero3) passes; gate cmd 2 is unaffected by the survey edits (MemConfig=InHbm default, no -DSG_MEM_*)."
